## Expected Behavior Changes

### Before Fixes:
```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": 1697123456789.123,
      "product_sku": "PB-001",  // ❌ Missing retailer
      "quantity": 1,             // ❌ Wrong quantity
      "unit": "item",            // ❌ Wrong unit
      "notes": "For basmati rice"
    }
  ],
  "message": "Shopping list generated with 1 items..."
}
```

### After Fixes:
```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
      "product_sku": "patel_brothers:PB-001",  // ✅ Proper format
      "quantity": 2,                            // ✅ Correct quantity
      "unit": "cups",                           // ✅ Correct unit
      "notes": "For basmati rice (Used in: Dal Tadka (lunch), Biryani (dinner))"
    }
  ],
  "message": "Shopping list generated with 1 items...",
  "warnings": {                                 // ✅ New warnings
    "unmapped_ingredients": ["saffron (5 strands)"],
    "count": 1,
    "message": "1 ingredient(s) could not be found in product catalog..."
  }
}
```

## Testing Checklist

After applying changes, verify:

- [ ] TypeScript compiles without errors
- [ ] Server starts successfully
- [ ] POST /shopping-lists/from-meal-plan returns 201
- [ ] Items have proper `retailer:sku` format
- [ ] Quantities match recipe requirements
- [ ] Unmapped ingredients appear in warnings
- [ ] Estimated totals calculate correctly
- [ ] No duplicate IDs in items
- [ ] Database persists shopping list correctly

